    "criterion_descriptions": [
      "Agent stays on the Debian Packages Bookworm page for curl and uses it as the sole source. Full credit if the agent clearly bases findings on the Bookworm curl page (whether starting there or navigating there). Partial credit if the agent appears to use another page/source despite the Bookworm page being accessible. Full credit if the agent reports an uncontrollable blocker (site down, access error) that prevents viewing the page content.",
